  "description": "When Soohyun, who was just a kid back then, had a look on his face as if he was tired of the world, Jiho couldn’t just leave him like that.\nTheir unexpected meeting was followed by a reunion seven years later, at Suhyun's father's funeral.\nDespite the seven-year gap, they quickly grew close as if they were always brothers. However, even with the eight-year age difference, Jiho, who found himself attracted to Soohyun, started pushing him away out of guilt...\n\"Hyung. You kept staring at me earlier outside.\"\n\"...\"\n\"I can show you more closely.\"\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/loveS2finale)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/loveS2finale), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/loves2finale)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/loveS2finale)",
